+# Recovered local crystal repair — 14 October 2026
+
+This checkpoint preserves the previously uncommitted edits to `factories.mjs`, `scripts/p21/export-three.mjs` and `scripts/p21/three-qa.cjs` exactly as found in the older detached website-readiness worktree. It is **unfinished, unverified work**, not a new asset acceptance or an integration-trunk release.
+
+The edits add explicit flat crystal facets/vertex colours and scoped repair provenance, plus stricter reuse of prior GLB/render hashes. The QA script still pins an older revision and requires a captured repair baseline. The generated GLBs, provenance and visual matrix have not been regenerated or accepted for these recovered source edits. Keep this checkpoint separate from production integration until those dependencies and visual/runtime checks are resolved.
+
+The retained `docs/p21-web/evidence/20261012-staging-review/01-blank-script-url.jpg` was already **zero bytes**. It is a failed/empty capture placeholder, not a valid screenshot or PASS evidence. Its exact empty contents are preserved; no image content is fabricated.
+
+Validation for preservation only: `node --check` on each of the three edited JavaScript files and `git diff --check`. No exporter, render matrix, ad serving, economy, gameplay or production deployment was run by this save operation.
